  "notes": "Elk Mastodon client, signed-out Explore. Near-monochrome off-white UI with a single warm orange brand (#cc7d24) used for the instance title, links and the Sign in pill; bookmark yellow and favorite pink act as state colours. Sidebar items unavailable to signed-out users are rendered dim grey while available ones (Explore, Local, Federated, Settings) are dark. Posts separated by hairline dividers rather than boxed; link previews are grey-filled rounded cards. Action row spreads 5 line icons evenly across the post width. Content-warning post shows a dotted rule with 'Show more' (spoiler/CW reveal) — no codebook entry. Avatars are circular illustrated faces. Panel scroll inside the main column; captured page taller than the 900px viewport.\n"
